{
  "id": "EvtSocialPublsh2",
  "name": "Event social demo: Publish approved posts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo: publish approved posts\nEvery minute: read rows set to **Approved**. Anything already in the Posted log is skipped. The rest go to the Page with Meta's photo-post call (`POST /{page-id}/photos`, `url` + `caption`), then the event ID is logged.\n\n**In this demo** `graph_url` points at a local mock with the same parameters, replies and error shape, and the token is made up. **For a real build:** `https://graph.facebook.com/v27.0`, a Page access token in an n8n credential, and an image link Meta can reach. Instagram is prepared in the same shape but not sent.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 320
      },
      "id": "79a9fbf6-d803-561b-8f89-d44ef519503c",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "83f22136-f0e1-5a8a-80af-ecff8ad2c42a",
      "name": "Every minute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "0df4734c-0f2f-52ea-8461-6f108300b6e3",
      "name": "Run now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e0bae67b-1d65-516e-a634-e017f557721c",
              "name": "sheet_url",
              "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/sheet",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1fa1d7b7-86f4-5699-bf75-10645a44b264",
              "name": "graph_url",
              "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/graph/v27.0",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "050145c7-e719-55a0-8bfa-89764b63ea22",
              "name": "page_id",
              "value": "100000000000001",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d72e6ea0-8762-5110-8156-da9bcfbd3b46",
              "name": "page_access_token",
              "value": "demo-page-token",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4941e7fc-eddd-55f4-aae0-18f693b08734",
              "name": "ig_user_id",
              "value": "17840000000000001",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8da5ad0-1f56-5f39-bf95-d442328e64d1",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.sheet_url }}/queue?status=Approved",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b5fc8791-3008-5996-8b2b-0d372d17b107",
      "name": "Read Approved rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.sheet_url }}/posted",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "29becb1c-907e-57af-ab15-d9f200797158",
      "name": "Read Posted log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One item per Approved row, flagged if its event ID is already in the Posted log\n// (or appears twice in this batch), so the same event can never be posted twice.\nconst rows = $('Read Approved rows').first().json.rows || [];\nconst posted = new Set(($('Read Posted log').first().json.rows || []).map((r) => String(r.event_id)));\n\nreturn rows.map((row) => {\n  const id = String(row.event_id);\n  const already_posted = posted.has(id);\n  posted.add(id);\n  return { json: { ...row, already_posted } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "6ef38fcf-8f88-592a-a957-8373c2801759",
      "name": "Skip anything already posted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dc8eb6ad-e039-5228-ae8b-48fefdff19af",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.already_posted }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "141828b4-e53c-53a6-a9f1-f21c54cbe987",
      "name": "Already posted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.sheet_url }}/queue/{{ $json.event_id }}/status",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: \"Already posted\" }) }}"
      },
      "id": "7d059441-e105-5aee-89fc-9273d45f53b9",
      "name": "Mark row Already posted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -80
      ]
    },
